---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/founder-operator-week-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/founder-operator-week-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="The standing week: one 30-minute kickoff, four 15-minute standups"
  caption="My current team's fixed meetings, late 2026. Bar length is minutes. Squares are the two release events."
>
  The fixed weekly meetings. Monday has a 30-minute kickoff that runs in this order: gaps, last week, this week,
  blockers, Wednesday's release. Tuesday to Friday each have a 15-minute standup. The release is cut at noon on Tuesday
  and goes out on Wednesday.
</Chart>
